Here is the fold in Rust:

```rust
pub fn fold(items: &[Item]) -> Vec<Row> {
    let mut rows = Vec::with_capacity(items.len());
    for item in items {
        match item.kind.as_str() {
            "tool" => push_tool(&mut rows, item),
            _ => rows.push(Row::from(item)),
        }
    }
    rows
}
```

The view side, in TypeScript:

```ts
export function rowHeight(row: Row): number {
  return row.kind === "tool" ? 26 : estimate(row.text);
}
```

